  "outOfScope": {
    "$comment": "Encodes the same payer policy but cannot be checked from here.",
    "medicallymodern1/stedi-monday-integration": "claim_assumptions.py (PAYER_RATE_SCHEDULE) and insurance_rules.py are the original source every TS/JS header cites. Different GitHub org, FastAPI on Render. Not reachable from a command-center-test session, so this checker cannot read it \u2014 verify it by hand when payer policy changes."
